  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;for every&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math>. Then the sum of all the elements of the set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is _________."
  },
